- op: discuss  # c55d
  at: '2026-03-04T03:38:02Z'  # c55d
  by: agent  # c55d
  actor: jgstern_agent  # c55d
  clock: 4  # c55d
  nonce: c55d  # c55d
  message: "Partially addressed in PR #1722: expanded method blocklist with 30 additional ubiquitous Rust methods (load, store, map, filter, collect, and_then, map_err, new, build, send, recv, etc). Directly fixes the .load() false positive (22/29 jolt callers) and .map_err() centrality issue (zksync-era). Remaining structural limitation: receiver type discrimination is not implemented and won't be — name-only resolution with conservative guards (blocklist + ambiguity threshold) is the intended design."  # c55d
- op: discuss  # c557
  at: '2026-03-04T04:03:52Z'  # c557
  by: human  # c557
